# vhs tape: recycle — run `just record` after `just demo-up`
Output docs/demo/recycle.gif
Set Shell fish
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1100
Set Height 380
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Type "nfctl recycle linear cat"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "nfctl logs linear cat -f"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Ctrl+C
